/target/
# Independent extension sources are developed locally and published only on submission
# branches that target `extension`; the application branch never tracks them.
/plugins/
# A local copy of the `languages` branch (one directory of language files per release); the application branch never
# tracks it, only the English template under crates/peersus-ui/languages/.
/languages/
/.flatpak-builder/
/.backup/
/.shots/
# Raw screenshots taken of devices while testing (they show people's pictures, paired devices and data): local evidence,
# never tracked. A picture the website shows is chosen, cut and described on its own (docs/website.md).
/shots/
/dist/
/benchmark-results/
/.direnv/
/result
/result-*
/android/.gradle/
/android/local.properties
/android/build/
/.wrangler/
# Legacy native staging is not an input; canonical artifacts live under target/android/.
/android/app/src/*/jniLibs/
**/.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
*.jks
*.keystore
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
keystore.properties
google-services.json
service-account*.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.cargo-ok
/vms/